              <section class="hub-section" id="install" data-animate="fade-up">
                <div class="hub-section-heading">
                  <h2>One command, everything.</h2>
                  <p>Runs on Ubuntu, Debian, Fedora, RHEL, Arch, and Alpine. Installs the panel, daemon, Node.js, and
                    Docker. An interactive TUI walks you through each step.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="install-block">
                  <div class="prose-code-block install-code">
                    <button class="prose-copy-btn" type="button" aria-label="Copy install command">
                      <iconify-icon icon="lucide:copy" width="11" height="11"></iconify-icon>
                      Copy
                    </button>
                    <code>curl -sSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/airlinklabs/panel/refs/heads/main/installer.sh | bash</code>
                  </div>
                  <p class="install-note">Or install panel only, daemon only, or just addons. Run with
                    <code>--help</code> for flags.
                  </p>
                  <div class="install-options"><a href="docs/deployment-guide/" class="text-link">Full deployment guide
                      <iconify-icon icon="lucide:arrow-right" width="14" height="14"></iconify-icon></a><a href="https://github.com/AirlinkLabs/panel" class="text-link">View source <iconify-icon icon="lucide:external-link" width="14" height="14"></iconify-icon></a></div>
                </div>
              </section>
              <section class="hub-section" id="projects" data-animate="fade-up">
                <div class="hub-section-heading">
                  <h2>Projects</h2>
                  <p>Panel is the web interface. Daemon runs on each node and handles the work.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="project-list" data-animate-group><a class="project-row"
                    href="https://github.com/AirlinkLabs/panel">
                    <div class="project-mark">
                      <img src="public/assets/icon.png" alt="" width="25" height="25">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                      <h3>AirLink Panel</h3>
                      <p>Manage servers, users, nodes, images, and backups from a web interface.</p>
                    </div><span class="project-link">View repo <iconify-icon icon="lucide:external-link" width="16" height="16"></iconify-icon></span>
                  </a><a class="project-row" href="https://github.com/AirlinkLabs/daemon">
                    <div class="project-mark project-mark--daemon"><img src="public/assets/icon.png" alt="" width="25"
                        height="25"></div>
                    <div>
                      <h3>AirLink Daemon</h3>
                      <p>Runs on each node to manage containers, files, transfers, and servers.</p>
                    </div><span class="project-link">View repo <iconify-icon icon="lucide:external-link" width="16" height="16"></iconify-icon></span>
                  </a></div>
              </section>
